Looking at this problem, I need to find all complex $z$ satisfying $\sum_{k=0}^{3^{1010}-1} (-2)^{f(k)}(z+k)^{2023}=0$, where $f(k)$ counts the ones in the base-3 representation of $k$.

Let me work through this systematically.

